| [`never-skip-ui-build-on-ui-change.mdc`](never-skip-ui-build-on-ui-change.mdc) | A UI change still requires a real UI build. This rule changes the **Rust profile only**; it never authorizes `-SkipUiBuild` on a change set that touches `ui/**` |
