## When development mode ends

**This rule is the thing to revisit.** When the workspace leaves development
mode -- a GA cut, a customer pilot, a signed partner drop -- the operator
flips the default back and this file is updated (or removed) in the same
change set. Until that happens, debug is the default everywhere and the
opt-in switches stay available for one-off release builds.

